WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.075
Who signs what?

2
00:00:01.075 --> 00:00:04.510
The platform owner and the
operator run the pre-flight,

3
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:08.250
the scheduled run and each ring
change, in the change window.

4
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.858
The detection engineer and the
approver read the detection plan,

5
00:00:11.858 --> 00:00:15.600
and record its hash in the change
record before anything is applied.

6
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.788
And the security officer signs the go or
no-go, from the test stage's own evidence.

7
00:00:20.788 --> 00:00:24.988
Remember: nothing in this chapter
has been run against a live tenant.

8
00:00:24.988 --> 00:00:28.270
Every live result is
written as an expectation.
